@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:（这里应该没有人了吧……？）|#0103Adv09_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了避免漏找，<br>艾玛一间间地检查着地下过道两侧的牢房。|#0103Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时——她在汉娜和可可的牢房那边，<br>发现汉娜还在里面。|#0103Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv09_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜背对着门口坐在地上，<br>专注地做着什么。|#0103Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜……？|#0103Adv09_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0103Adv09_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:轻声呼唤时，<br>汉娜的肩膀夸张地抖了一下。|#0103Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆棒読み気味に

[PrintTextModified Text:哎，哎呀艾玛！<br>吓了我一跳～！|#0103Adv09_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜慌忙地<br>把手中的东西藏到毯子下面。|#0103Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:（那是什么……？）|#0103Adv09_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么都没有！<br>请、请不要在意！|#0103Adv09_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎注意到艾玛疑惑的眼神，<br>汉娜慌慌张张地从牢房里出来。|#0103Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0103Adv09_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为对方有所隐瞒，<br>艾玛露出了有些失落的表情。<br>看到这个反应，汉娜更加慌乱了。|#0103Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:真、真的不是什么大不了的事！<br>也不是在做什么危险的事！|#0103Adv09_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个……我是在给艾玛做礼物，<br>希望能让你开心起来。|#0103Adv09_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为艾玛你最近一直卧床，<br>我就想给你做些东西，当作是慰问品……|#0103Adv09_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜移开视线，<br>有些不好意思地说道。|#0103Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:礼物……？|#0103Adv09_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不用大惊小怪的啦！？<br>不是什么很了不起的东西！|#0103Adv09_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜……|#0103Adv09_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛感动得眼眶湿润。|#0103Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:真的不是什么特别的东西，<br>请不要太当回事！|#0103Adv09_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我先过去了！|#0103Adv09_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。那一会见。|#0103Adv09_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Hanna Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜像是要掩饰害羞似的，<br>气冲冲地离开了。|#0103Adv09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

